  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIPS Core support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HIPS k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HIPS vision lyder &apos;Ett stabilt och fredligt Somalia, d&#xe4;r policy formulering baseras p&#xe5; tillf&#xf6;rlitlig och inkluderande forskning.
F&#xf6;r att &#xe5; visionen har HIPS identifierat fem strategiska m&#xe5;l, d&#xe4;r de tre sista &#xe4;r outputs f&#xf6;r att n&#xe5; de tv&#xe5; f&#xf6;rsta m&#xe5;len (p&#xe5; outcome niv&#xe5;).

1. Producera forskning och policyf&#xf6;rslag som baseras p&#xe5; tillf&#xf6;rlitlig information inom omr&#xe5;dena f&#xf6;rsoning, r&#xe4;ttssektorn, demokratisering, fred och s&#xe4;kerhet, social- och ekonomisk utveckling, milj&#xf6; och klimat samt j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet. 

2. Att stimulera offentlig dialog och p&#xe5;verka den offentliga politiken inom f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsdom&#xe4;ner.

3. Att bidra till de somaliska institutionernas och forskarnas kapacitet.

4. Att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra institutets kapacitet och fullst&#xe4;ndigt digitalisera dess k&#xe4;rnfunktioner.

5. Att bygga ett freds- och forskningscenter i Mogadishu f&#xf6;r att konsolidera operativ effektivitet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Vision of HIPS is formulated as; &#x2018;A stable and peaceful Somalia guided by policies based on sound research and inclusive deliberations&#x2019;. In order to strive for the vision, HIPS has identified five strategic objectives, where the three last ones are outputs to reach the two first ones.

1. Produce research and policy proposals based on reliable information in the areas of reconciliation, the justice sector, democratization, peace and security, social and economic development, environment and climate, and gender equality.

2. To stimulate public dialogue and influence public policy in domains of change.

3. To contribute to the capacity of Somali institutions and researchers.

4. To improve the Institute&apos;s capacity and fully digitize its core functions.

5. To build a peace and research center in Mogadishu to consolidate operational efficiency.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Vision of HIPS is formulated as; A stable and peaceful Somalia guided by policies based on sound research and inclusive deliberations. In order to strive for the vision, HIPS has identified five strategic objectives, where the three last ones are outputs to reach the two first ones.

1. To produce timely, evidence-based, and realistic research products, policy proposals and assessments relating to reconciliation, the rule of law, democratisation, peace and security, social/ economic development, environment/climate change and gender-related issues.

2. To stimulate public dialogue and influence public policy in the domains of change.

3. To contribute to the capacity of the Somali institutions and researchers.

4. To improve the capacity of the Institute and fully digitize its core operational functions.

5. To build a Peace and Research Centre in Mogadishu to consolidate operational effectiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
